The segment maps, datatype maps, and concept maps in this package are derived
from the HL7 V2-to-FHIR Implementation Guide, published by Health Level Seven
International ("HL7") at https://github.com/HL7/v2-to-fhir, which states
Apache-2.0 on GitHub. The Implementation Guide describes itself as
informational and not an authorized publication. This package is not an HL7
publication, and HL7 neither endorses nor warrants it.

Derived content, and the source each part comes from:

  * Segment maps and datatype maps under src/schema -- the segment and
    datatype mapping spreadsheets of the V2-to-FHIR Implementation Guide,
    read and written out by hand.

  * Concept maps under src/schema/vocabularies.ts -- the ConceptMap resources
    of the V2-to-FHIR Implementation Guide, and the HL7v2 tables and HL7
    Terminology (UTG) code systems they reference.

FHIR element names and the US Core profile URLs this package writes are
reproduced from the FHIR R4 specification and the US Core Implementation
Guide as published.

